<title>UK: North Avon Investments prices 77.6 mln stg bond.</title>
<headline>North Avon Investments prices 77.6 mln stg bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced</p>
<p>earlier by joint lead managers Daiwa and UBS, has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NORTH AVON INVESTMENTS LTD</p>
<p> AMT    77.6 MLN STG  COUPON     8.12	MATURITY    05.OCT.26</p>
<p> TYPE   COLLATERAL    ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE  S-14.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.75	REOFFER    =	   AVE LIFE    24.2 YRS</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    QUARTERLY</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 8.0 PCT GILT DUE 2021</p>
<p> NOTES	S SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
